{
  "pid": "public-medium-06",
  "source": "public",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "Slab Thickness Alarm and Fault History",
  "requirements": "Monitor slab-thickness faults on a stone-cutting line, including minimum alarm holding, fault counting, normal-cutting runtime accumulation and a history of the five most recent faults.\n\n1. When THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID is TRUE, THICKNESS_FAULT indicates that thickness deviation exceeds tolerance. Activate THICKNESS_ALARM immediately when the fault becomes TRUE, and hold each triggered alarm for at least 500 ms. Keep the alarm active while the fault persists.\n2. On each FALSE-to-TRUE transition of a valid fault signal, increment Slab_Fault_Counter and store the current FaultTimestamp in element 0 of Slab_Fault_History. Shift older entries toward higher indices, retaining only the five most recent entries.\n3. Accumulate Slab_Runtime_Accumulator using CycleTime only while CUTTING_RUN is TRUE, the thickness signal is valid and no thickness fault is present. Otherwise preserve the accumulated value.\n4. At power-up or whenever THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID is FALSE, switch off the alarm and clear its holding state. Do not add fault records or accumulate normal runtime while the signal is invalid.\n5. At power-up, initialize the fault count, accumulated runtime and all five history entries to zero. Statistics and history are for observation and maintenance only; they must not alter the cutting equipment's operating permissive, and external callers must not modify history entries.",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "THICKNESS_FAULT",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Thickness deviation exceeds the permitted tolerance.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Thickness-signal validity; FALSE means the signal is lost or unavailable.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "CUTTING_RUN",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Actual cutting-equipment running status.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "FaultTimestamp",
      "data_type": "DINT",
      "description": "Current timestamp in seconds, used as the fault-record identifier.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "CycleTime",
      "data_type": "TIME",
      "description": "Actual elapsed interval represented by this invocation; must be positive.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "THICKNESS_ALARM",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Thickness alarm with a minimum 500 ms hold duration.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Slab_Fault_Counter",
      "data_type": "UINT",
      "description": "Number of valid thickness-fault occurrences.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Slab_Runtime_Accumulator",
      "data_type": "LTIME",
      "description": "Accumulated normal-cutting runtime.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Slab_Fault_History",
      "data_type": "ARRAY[0..4] OF DINT",
      "description": "Five most recent fault timestamps; index 0 is newest; read-only to callers.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "当厚度信号无效时，厚度报警必须为 FALSE（无效信号不得报警）",
      "ltl": "G(THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID = FALSE -> THICKNESS_ALARM = FALSE)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "有效健康切割的运行时间按实际调用间隔递增，TIME以毫秒、LTIME以纳秒记录。",
      "ltl": "G((CUTTING_RUN AND THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID AND NOT THICKNESS_FAULT) -> Slab_Runtime_Accumulator = prev(Slab_Runtime_Accumulator) + CycleTime * 1000000)",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "当信号有效且厚度故障存在时，厚度报警必须为 TRUE（有效故障立即报警）",
      "ltl": "G(THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID = TRUE AND THICKNESS_FAULT = TRUE -> THICKNESS_ALARM = TRUE)",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "可表示时段内，运行时间只增或保持。",
      "ltl": "G(Slab_Runtime_Accumulator >= prev(Slab_Runtime_Accumulator))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "历史 index0 记录到时间戳时，故障计数必须已经至少为 1",
      "ltl": "G(Slab_Fault_History[0] <> 0 -> Slab_Fault_Counter >= 1)",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S6",
      "text": "故障计数与 5 条历史队列的写入与移位顺序（未满 5 条与满后移位两种状态）：由用例验证的数据性质",
      "ltl": "",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S7",
      "text": "无合格切割时运行累计保持。",
      "ltl": "G(NOT (CUTTING_RUN AND THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID AND NOT THICKNESS_FAULT) -> Slab_Runtime_Accumulator = prev(Slab_Runtime_Accumulator))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S8",
      "text": "仅有效故障的上升沿累加计数，在未达到 UINT 上限时加一。",
      "ltl": "G(((rising((THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID AND THICKNESS_FAULT)) AND NOT prev(Slab_Fault_Counter = 65535)) -> Slab_Fault_Counter = prev(Slab_Fault_Counter) + 1) AND (NOT rising((THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID AND THICKNESS_FAULT)) -> Slab_Fault_Counter = prev(Slab_Fault_Counter)))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S9",
      "text": "新故障写入时间戳并逐槽后移其余四条，无新沿时全部五条保持。",
      "ltl": "G((rising((THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID AND THICKNESS_FAULT)) -> (Slab_Fault_History[0] = FaultTimestamp AND Slab_Fault_History[1] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[0]) AND Slab_Fault_History[2] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[1]) AND Slab_Fault_History[3] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[2]) AND Slab_Fault_History[4] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[3]))) AND (NOT rising((THICKNESS_SIGNAL_VALID AND THICKNESS_FAULT)) -> (Slab_Fault_History[0] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[0]) AND Slab_Fault_History[1] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[1]) AND Slab_Fault_History[2] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[2]) AND Slab_Fault_History[3] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[3]) AND Slab_Fault_History[4] = prev(Slab_Fault_History[4]))))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S10",
      "text": "报警至少保持到触发后500毫秒，故障持续时保持；信号无效时立即清除。按实际间隔及触发后499毫秒的边界检查。",
      "ltl": "",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    }
  ],
